只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"RETIRED 2026-10-05 — the official DeepSeek Harness now ships the Agent Teams subsystem (dsh-experimental-agent-team). Use native Agent Teams, or a better-adopted alternative such as @nanmicoder/dsh-agent-teams.","id":"gh:1366256154","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-team-rooms","slug":"PerryLink/dsh-team-rooms","topics":["ai-agent","ai-agents","collaboration","cordis","cross-session","deepseek-harness","developer-tools","dsh","dsh-plugin","message-bus","multi-agent","task-board","team-rooms"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"RETIRED 2026-10-05 — the official DeepSeek Harness now ships the Agent Teams subsystem (dsh-experime"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ntal-agent-team). Use native Agent Teams, or a better-adopted alternative such as @nanmicoder/dsh-ag"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"-team). Use native Agent Teams, or a better-adopted alternative such as @nanmicoder/dsh-agent-teams."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# 🏠 dsh-team-rooms\n- **1024 store channel**: `npm i -g dsh1024` once, then `dsh1024 plugin --profile"},{"id":"p2s2","text":" web add dsh-team-rooms` (counts toward the deepseek1024.com install ranking)."},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Persistent, cross-session multi-agent team rooms for DeepSeek Harness — members, a message bus, a "},{"id":"p3s2","text":"shared task board, and a shared timeline that survive restarts.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"*Each member is an independent DSH session; the room is the shared durable object between them.*"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> 🪦 **RETIRED — compatibility updates stopped as of 2026-10-05.** Team coordination is now **impleme"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"nted by the official harness itself** `dsh-experimental-agent-team` (with `-tool-agent-team`) provid"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"es an implicit-root roster, a **durable peer mailbox** and a shared **task DAG** with compare-and-se"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"t updates, plus a Web projection. ⚠️ The shipped `dsh-base` bundle keeps it **disabled** — a profile"},{"id":"p5s5","text":" patch enables it and disables the legacy continuable-child control names. Well-adopted **community "},{"id":"p5s6","text":"alternatives** also exist — for example `@nanmicoder/dsh-agent-teams` (~13k weekly downloads), thoug"},{"id":"p5s7","text":"h as of 2026-10-05 its declared peers **stop below the `0.2.1` line**, so the host's compatibility g"},{"id":"p5s8","text":"uard **skips** it on `0.2.1-alpha.1` unless you add a per-version exemption. The one thing this pack"},{"id":"p5s9","text":"age did that the native subsystem does not is coordinate **independent sessions in separate processe"},{"id":"p5s10","text":"s**; with 589 weekly downloads against a native subsystem plus several community alternatives, that "},{"id":"p5s11","text":"niche no longer justifies compatibility upkeep. 👉 **Use the native Agent Teams, or a more widely ado"},{"id":"p5s12","text":"pted community alternative.** This repository stays public for reference."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"English · 简体中文 · Español · Português · हिन्दी"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Compatibility"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Host `0.1.2-alpha.2` and later fails closed on the session event vocabulary, so this plugin no longe"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"r writes its log-only fact events (`team-room/fact`) there: facts route to the logger/panel channel "},{"id":"p9s3","text":"instead and the `teamRoom` projection degrades to an empty fold. Older rc lines (through `0.1.1-rc.2"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"`) keep the ignorable-marker discipline. The client half rides the current client packages (`dsh-api"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"-session-controller`, `dsh-client-ui-slots`, `dsh-client-ui-settings`, `dsh-client-locale`, `dsh-cli"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"ontroller`, `dsh-client-ui-slots`, `dsh-client-ui-settings`, `dsh-client-locale`, `dsh-client-web`)."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"**Data compatibility with `dsh-background-agents` 0.9.6 is a hard rule.** These strings are byte-ide"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"ntical to 0.9.6 and must never be renamed: the storage domain `team_rooms`, the `teamRoom` projectio"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"n key, the `team-room/fact` session event type, and the `team-rooms` settings-slot id. An existing p"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"rofile therefore keeps its rooms, its member logs, and its settings page when you swap the plugin."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| Surface | Status |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| Harness | DeepSeek Harness `dsh-v0.2.1-alpha.1` (verified 2026-09-25; dev and runtime pins `0.1.7-"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"rc.2`, peers `>=0.1.2-rc.1 <0.2.0 \\|\\| >=0.1.5-alpha.1 <0.2.0 \\|\\| >=0.1.6-0 <0.2.0 \\|\\| >=0.1.7-0 <"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"0.2.0`) |\n| Node | `^22.19.0 \\|\\| >=24.0.0` |\n| Platforms | All (host tools; the settings page needs"},{"id":"p12s4","text":" the Web client half and the storage-domain capability) |\n| Model | Any (rooms carry no model route "},{"id":"p12s5","text":"— members are ordinary sessions) |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## What you get"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"`dsh-team-rooms` turns several independent sessions into one coordinated team:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"1. **The `/room` command family** — `create`, `join`, `leave`, `list`, `send`, `tasks`, `task add|as"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"sign|claim|done|delete`. Rooms are named, owned, and addressed by a stable room id you can paste int"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"o another session.\n2. **Eight `room_*` tools** — `room_list_rooms`, `room_post`, `room_read`, `room_"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"list_tasks`, `room_create_task`, `room_claim_task`, `room_transfer_task`, `room_complete_task`. The "},{"id":"p15s5","text":"model works the shared board and the bus from inside its own session; `room_transfer_task` asks for "},{"id":"p15s6","text":"approval before a cross-member handoff.\n3. **A durable room store** — members, the message bus (dire"},{"id":"p15s7","text":"cted or broadcast), the task board, and the timeline live in the `team_rooms` storage domain (SQLite"},{"id":"p15s8","text":" or JSONL backend — the deployment chooses; the plugin adds no service of its own) and recover acros"},{"id":"p15s9","text":"s DSH restarts.\n4. **A Web settings page** — the Team Rooms settings section shows member status, th"},{"id":"p15s10","text":"e task board, and the timeline of every room the current session belongs to, read from the `teamRoom"},{"id":"p15s11","text":"` session projection and written back through the host `/room` command."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## How it works — and why it survives restarts"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"The room store is the cross-session authority; the session projection is each member's own reconstru"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"cted copy. Two writes run at once and stay consistent:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Security boundaries"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"- **Approval-gated handoffs.** `room_transfer_task` routes through the official approval seam and fa"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"ils closed when no approval service is composed or no answerer grants it — nothing changes on a refu"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"sal.\n- **Model-visible ⟺ logged.** Every delivered room message is a durable `user/message` in the m"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"ember's own log; the shared timeline mirrors as log-only `team-room/fact` events. A room message can"},{"id":"p20s5","text":" never reach a model without being recorded.\n- **Membership is the authorization boundary.** Every `"},{"id":"p20s6","text":"room_*` tool authorizes against the calling session's own membership; a non-member gets a stable rej"},{"id":"p20s7","text":"ection, not a partial write.\n- **Retention is bounded.** Bus, timeline, and done-task windows are en"},{"id":"p20s8","text":"forced on every write, so a long-lived room cannot grow without limit.\n- **No scheduling, no cross-m"},{"id":"p20s9","text":"achine members.** A member is a process-local session of this deployment."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Known limitations"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"- Rooms require the storage domain to be composed; without `@deepseek-ai/dsh-storage-domain`, the `/"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"room` command and the `room_*` tools are disabled.\n- A room needs at least two members to be interes"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"ting, and the roster is bounded by `maxMembersPerRoom`; membership is per session, not per user.\n- T"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"here is no cross-machine membership: every member is a process-local session of this deployment.\n- `"},{"id":"p22s5","text":"room_transfer_task` needs an approval answerer. Without one it fails closed by design, so automated "},{"id":"p22s6","text":"profiles that want handoffs must compose an approval service.\n- Cost/usage accounting is out of scop"},{"id":"p22s7","text":"e here (that lived in the background-agent half); the room surfaces report structure, not spend."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
